# SmartSpectra API key — register free at https://physiology.presagetech.com/auth/register
# The main process reads this; it is never exposed to the renderer (see app/preload).
# Copy this file to .env — the main process loads it at startup, in development.
#
# Quote the value if it contains a #, like KEY="ab#cd". Unquoted, a # starts a
# comment and the rest of the value is dropped silently, which looks like a key
# the SDK simply rejects.
SMARTSPECTRA_API_KEY=
